<mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Locked at the start, and what opens it&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;STEM cabinet (he): star key from the apron, once The Night Sky's note has been read&lt;br&gt;Stage drawer (hn): the beater from under the blocks, struck green, red, blue, yellow (the page of music)&lt;br&gt;Paint cupboard (ae): dials set purple, green, orange (the stripes under Mary's moth)&lt;br&gt;Mary's locker (h1): 4 3 6 (the three slips read on the timetable with the whiteboard key)&lt;br&gt;Nothing else is locked; every doorway is open from the start." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#fff;strokeColor=#999;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="400" y="70" width="330" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
